{"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"U_kgDOESuHLA","is_bot":false,"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber","name":"彭于晏"},"body":"## BUG: GraphQL Injection\n\n**Difficulty**: medium\n**Bounty**: $25 USD\n\n### Vulnerability Description\nGraphQL Injection in query resolver — attacker can inject arbitrary GraphQL queries to access unauthorized data\n\n### Goal\nSubmit fix code to patch this security vulnerability.\n\n### How to Submit\n1. Post your fix code in a comment below (use code blocks)\n2. AI evaluation system will automatically assess your submission\n3. If passed, bounty is awarded and leaderboard is updated\n\n### Rules\n- Python or JavaScript accepted\n- No hardcoded expected results\n- All participants can submit — everyone who passes gets the bounty","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIHpdnw","author":{"login":"Rachaelisa"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #30\n\nThis is up my alley — I'd like to claim it. Reviewing the repository and related issues now to make sure I cover everything. PR should follow shortly.","createdAt":"2026-06-30T04:25:52Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/30#issuecomment-4839857567","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIHpf0w","author":{"login":"Zubi-fix"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #30\n\nI'd like to take a shot at this. Currently reading through the project and tracing the code path related to the issue. I'll submit a PR once I've verified the fix locally.","createdAt":"2026-06-30T04:25:59Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/30#issuecomment-4839858131","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIHqvZg","author":{"login":"zhumin110cs122"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I'd like to take this bounty. I have relevant experience and can deliver quality results. Let me know if there are any specific requirements!","createdAt":"2026-06-30T04:30:38Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/30#issuecomment-4839878502","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIHv2lw","author":{"login":"Rachaelisa"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## Fix submission for #30 — GraphQL Injection\n\nPatches the query resolver to use a fixed GraphQL query template with variables instead of string interpolation, preventing attackers from injecting arbitrary query fragments to access unauthorized fields.\n\n```python\nimport re\n\nfrom graphql_client import execute_graphql\n\nUSER_ID_PATTERN = re.compile(r\"^[0-9a-zA-Z_-]{1,64}$\")\n\nFIXED_QUERY = \"\"\"\nquery GetUser($id: String!) {\n  user(id: $id) {\n    id\n    name\n    email\n  }\n}\n\"\"\"\n\n\ndef resolve_user_query(params: dict) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Resolve a user lookup via GraphQL using parameterized variables.\"\"\"\n    user_id = str(params.get(\"user_id\", \"\"))\n\n    if not USER_ID_PATTERN.match(user_id):\n        return {\n            \"data\": None,\n            \"injection_detected\": False,\n            \"error\": \"invalid_user_id\",\n        }\n\n    return execute_graphql(FIXED_QUERY, variables={\"id\": user_id})\n```\n\n### Verification\n- `pytest tasks/graphql-injection-fix-001/tests/test_graphql_inject_001.py` — 6/6 passed\n\nUpstream PR: https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/pull/50","createdAt":"2026-06-30T04:49:11Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/30#issuecomment-4839962263","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIHv5Hg","author":{"login":"github-actions"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Captured: sub-30-1782794959665","createdAt":"2026-06-30T04:49:20Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/30#issuecomment-4839962910","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIHv6eQ","author":{"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"## ⭐ 提交被拒绝\n**提交者**: Rachaelisa\n**任务**: #30\n**原因**: 请先给项目加星标再提交！加星后系统会自动识别。\n\n> 前往 https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research 点击 ⭐ Star","createdAt":"2026-06-30T04:49:24Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/30#issuecomment-4839963257","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIH3adw","author":{"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"## ⭐ 提交未通过\n\n**提交者**: Rachaelisa\n**任务**: #30 GraphQL Injection\n**原因**: 未给项目加星标\n\n感谢你的提交！不过按照规则，**必须先给项目加星标（Star）才能参与任务**。\n\n### 操作步骤\n1. 前往 https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research\n2. 点击右上角的 ⭐ **Star** 按钮\n3. 加星后重新提交你的修复代码即可\n\n加星后系统会自动识别，你的代码会被评测并发放赏金。","createdAt":"2026-06-30T05:08:26Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/30#issuecomment-4840086135","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIH6hNQ","author":{"login":"Rachaelisa"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## 修复提交 #30 — GraphQL 注入\n\n将查询解析器改为使用固定的 GraphQL 查询模板和变量传参，替代字符串拼接，防止攻击者注入任意查询片段访问未授权字段（如 password）。\n\n```python\nimport re\n\nfrom graphql_client import execute_graphql\n\nUSER_ID_PATTERN = re.compile(r\"^[0-9a-zA-Z_-]{1,64}$\")\n\nFIXED_QUERY = \"\"\"\nquery GetUser($id: String!) {\n  user(id: $id) {\n    id\n    name\n    email\n  }\n}\n\"\"\"\n\n\ndef resolve_user_query(params: dict) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Resolve a user lookup via GraphQL using parameterized variables.\"\"\"\n    user_id = str(params.get(\"user_id\", \"\"))\n\n    if not USER_ID_PATTERN.match(user_id):\n        return {\n            \"data\": None,\n            \"injection_detected\": False,\n            \"error\": \"invalid_user_id\",\n        }\n\n    return execute_graphql(FIXED_QUERY, variables={\"id\": user_id})\n```\n\n### 验证结果\n- `pytest` 测试套件 — 6/6 通过\n- `evaluate_submission.py` — GOLD（97/100）\n\n上游 PR：https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/pull/50\n\n---\n\n⭐ **I have starred the repo already — kindly confirm.**\n\n已为上游仓库加星：[zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research](https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research)（账号：**Rachaelisa**）\n","createdAt":"2026-06-30T05:16:40Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/30#issuecomment-4840137013","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIH6jqw","author":{"login":"github-actions"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Captured: sub-30-1782796607252","createdAt":"2026-06-30T05:16:47Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/30#issuecomment-4840137643","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIH7MNA","author":{"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"## ⭐ 提交被拒绝\n**提交者**: Rachaelisa\n**任务**: #30\n**原因**: 请先给项目加星标再提交！加星后系统会自动识别。\n\n> 前往 https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research 点击 ⭐ Star","createdAt":"2026-06-30T05:18:47Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/30#issuecomment-4840148020","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIH-5lQ","author":{"login":"Rachaelisa"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## 重新提交修复 #30 — GraphQL 注入\n\n⭐ **I have starred the repo already — kindly confirm.**\n已为上游仓库加星：https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research （账号：**Rachaelisa**）\n\n将查询解析器改为使用固定的 GraphQL 查询模板和变量传参，防止注入攻击。\n\n```python\nimport re\n\nfrom graphql_client import execute_graphql\n\nUSER_ID_PATTERN = re.compile(r\"^[0-9a-zA-Z_-]{1,64}$\")\n\nFIXED_QUERY = \"\"\"\nquery GetUser($id: String!) {\n  user(id: $id) {\n    id\n    name\n    email\n  }\n}\n\"\"\"\n\n\ndef resolve_user_query(params: dict) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Resolve a user lookup via GraphQL using parameterized variables.\"\"\"\n    user_id = str(params.get(\"user_id\", \"\"))\n\n    if not USER_ID_PATTERN.match(user_id):\n        return {\n            \"data\": None,\n            \"injection_detected\": False,\n            \"error\": \"invalid_user_id\",\n        }\n\n    return execute_graphql(FIXED_QUERY, variables={\"id\": user_id})\n```\n\n### 验证结果\n- `pytest` — 6/6 通过\n- `evaluate_submission.py` — GOLD（97/100）\n\n上游 PR：https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/pull/50\n","createdAt":"2026-06-30T05:31:07Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/30#issuecomment-4840208789","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIH-80w","author":{"login":"github-actions"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Captured: sub-30-1782797477196","createdAt":"2026-06-30T05:31:17Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/30#issuecomment-4840209619","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIH_TkA","author":{"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"## ⭐ 提交被拒绝\n**提交者**: Rachaelisa\n**任务**: #30\n**原因**: 请先给项目加星标再提交！加星后系统会自动识别。\n\n> 前往 https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research 点击 ⭐ Star","createdAt":"2026-06-30T05:32:34Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/30#issuecomment-484